      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 209376,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T12:06:36.488854",
      "section_id": "S1_HOOK",
      "voiceover_text": "Across the world, conversations about artificial intelligence are raising a central question: what does it mean for technology to serve people? in what domain with what possible responses. Now, to help us there, I argue in the near term, we need what we've called a Gaia, a global AI observatory. And guess what? Siri and many other things like Siri are not just on the way they're already here. Stealthily, embedding itself into every aspect of our lives, poised to rewrite the very rules of our existence."
    },
