      "created_at": "2026-06-23T12:06:40.648866",
      "section_id": "S2_CONTEXT",
      "voiceover_text": "Across the AI4IA conversations, Change Climate is presented not as an abstraction, but as a challenge with concrete human consequences — for people who depend on these systems to work, and work fairly. in what domain with what possible responses. Now, to help us there, I argue in the near term, we need what we've called a Gaia, a global AI observatory. And guess what? Siri and many other things like Siri are not just on the way they're already here."
    },
