      "section_id": "S3_EVIDENCE",
      "voiceover_text": "But the arrival of AI in Change Climate does not resolve the underlying tensions. It often sharpens them — exposing who has voice, who has access, and who bears the risks. Hi everyone, my name is David Dell and I work with the United Nations University and today I'm going to present AI in an environment and climate change the cost regulations, applications and benefits. The first thing that comes on our mind when you think when we think of AI is we need fast computers, we need database infrastructures."
