      "section_id": "S5_RESPONSE",
      "voiceover_text": "Across these conversations, Change Climate is not a distant aspiration. It is a field in motion — with real evidence, real failure, and real possibilities for change. For this, the policies and legal frameworks of the governments also age. In fact, they go against the principles of sustainable development goals. But because AI is expected to display so many jobs and really bring a new way of working this is an important area for us in the Caribbean to make sure that we prepare our citizens for the changing demands of the digital era."
