      "section_id": "S6_SYNTHESIS",
      "voiceover_text": "The measure of AI will not be the speed of its systems, but whether the people it touches are better served, better heard, and more free. I will give some examples of about AI at UNU, we are using the neural network and machine learning to improve the detection of flood and drought. There are other people who are using AI models for climate and weather forecast and then these most models eventually they are not perfect, but at least they agree with classical models in short term forecast."
